Subject: Language screen at the first start

When no settings file was found at the start, the firmware shows a list of
languages before its first screen: no title, the wheel moves, Select picks,
Menu and the other buttons do nothing. The list comes from languages.txt in the
language folder. The language is set as the Language setting would set it, and
the settings file is written at once, so the screen does not come back.

